{"schema_version":"1.0","language":"en","edition":"en-ak","revision":"0","book":{"position":20,"code":"PRO","name":"Proverbs","testament":"OT"},"chapter":17,"content":[{"type":"para","marker":"p","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"1","sid":"PRO 17:1"},"Better ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," a dry morsel, and quietness therewith, than an house full of sacrifices ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["with"]}," strife. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 17:1"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"2","sid":"PRO 17:2"},"A wise servant shall have rule over a son that causeth shame, and shall have part of the inheritance among the brethren. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 17:2"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"3","sid":"PRO 17:3"},"The fining pot ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," for silver, and the furnace for gold: but the LORD trieth the hearts. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 17:3"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"4","sid":"PRO 17:4"},"A wicked doer giveth heed to false lips; ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["and"]}," a liar giveth ear to a naughty tongue. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 17:4"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"5","sid":"PRO 17:5"},"Whoso mocketh the poor reproacheth his Maker: ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["and"]}," he that is glad at calamities shall not be unpunished. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 17:5"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"6","sid":"PRO 17:6"},"Children’s children ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["are"]}," the crown of old men; and the glory of children ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["are"]}," their fathers. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 17:6"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"7","sid":"PRO 17:7"},"Excellent speech becometh not a fool: much less do lying lips a prince. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 17:7"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"8","sid":"PRO 17:8"},"A gift ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is as"]}," a precious stone in the eyes of him that hath it: whithersoever it turneth, it prospereth. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 17:8"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"9","sid":"PRO 17:9"},"He that covereth a transgression seeketh love; but he that repeateth a matter separateth ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["very"]}," friends. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 17:9"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"10","sid":"PRO 17:10"},"A reproof entereth more into a wise man than an hundred stripes into a fool. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 17:10"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"11","sid":"PRO 17:11"},"An evil ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["man"]}," seeketh only rebellion: therefore a cruel messenger shall be sent against him. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 17:11"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"12","sid":"PRO 17:12"},"Let a bear robbed of her whelps meet a man, rather than a fool in his folly. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 17:12"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"13","sid":"PRO 17:13"},"Whoso rewardeth evil for good, evil shall not depart from his house. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 17:13"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"14","sid":"PRO 17:14"},"The beginning of strife ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is as"]}," when one letteth out water: therefore leave off contention, before it be meddled with. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 17:14"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"15","sid":"PRO 17:15"},"He that justifieth the wicked, and he that condemneth the just, even they both ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["are"]}," abomination to the LORD. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 17:15"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"16","sid":"PRO 17:16"},"Wherefore ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is there"]}," a price in the hand of a fool to get wisdom, seeing ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["he hath"]}," no heart ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["to it? "]},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 17:16"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"17","sid":"PRO 17:17"},"A friend loveth at all times, and a brother is born for adversity. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 17:17"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"18","sid":"PRO 17:18"},"A man void of understanding striketh hands, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["and"]}," becometh surety in the presence of his friend. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 17:18"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"19","sid":"PRO 17:19"},"He loveth transgression that loveth strife: ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["and"]}," he that exalteth his gate seeketh destruction. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 17:19"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"20","sid":"PRO 17:20"},"He that hath a froward heart findeth no good: and he that hath a perverse tongue falleth into mischief. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 17:20"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"21","sid":"PRO 17:21"},"He that begetteth a fool ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["doeth it"]}," to his sorrow: and the father of a fool hath no joy. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 17:21"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"22","sid":"PRO 17:22"},"A merry heart doeth good ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["like"]}," a medicine: but a broken spirit drieth the bones. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 17:22"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"23","sid":"PRO 17:23"},"A wicked ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["man"]}," taketh a gift out of the bosom to pervert the ways of judgment. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 17:23"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"24","sid":"PRO 17:24"},"Wisdom ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," before him that hath understanding; but the eyes of a fool ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["are"]}," in the ends of the earth. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 17:24"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"25","sid":"PRO 17:25"},"A foolish son ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," a grief to his father, and bitterness to her that bare him. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 17:25"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"26","sid":"PRO 17:26"},"Also to punish the just ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," not good, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["nor"]}," to strike princes for equity. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 17:26"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"27","sid":"PRO 17:27"},"He that hath knowledge spareth his words: ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["and"]}," a man of understanding is of an excellent spirit. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 17:27"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"28","sid":"PRO 17:28"},"Even a fool, when he holdeth his peace, is counted wise: ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["and "]},"he that shutteth his lips ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is esteemed"]}," a man of understanding. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 17:28"}]}]}
